357
00:19:55,310 --> 00:19:56,400
Are you going back to class?

358
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:57,640
I’ll go with you.

359
00:19:58,590 --> 00:20:00,250
Zhao Shuran, you are so weird.

360
00:20:00,790 --> 00:20:03,030
You knew I was scammed, right?

361
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:05,960
Isn't it miserable to just
hold it in and wait

362
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:07,030
for me to slip up?

363
00:20:07,110 --> 00:20:07,790
You...

364
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:10,400
Yes, I didn't go to the concert.

365
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:11,590
So what?

366
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:14,080
My classmates were so worried about me.

367
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:15,640
They sneaked into the QQ group

368
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:16,880
to find the trading location.

369
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,030
After they found me,

370
00:20:18,030 --> 00:20:19,070
we caught that scalper

371
00:20:19,070 --> 00:20:20,920
on Tieba together.

372
00:20:21,270 --> 00:20:22,200
Let me tell you,

373
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:24,550
so many fans wanted to gift me a banner.

374
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:25,830
I said, "No, no.

375
00:20:25,830 --> 00:20:27,510
We're doing this for the people.
It's a given."

376
00:20:27,510 --> 00:20:28,510
Tang Tingting,

377
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:31,120
quit spouting the nonsense you dreamed up.

378
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:34,270
I bet this would be a good dream for you.

379
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:36,920
After helping the people,

380
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:38,310
Lin Zhixia found the best place

381
00:20:38,310 --> 00:20:40,110
outside the venue for us

382
00:20:40,110 --> 00:20:41,410
to listen to the concert together.

383
00:20:41,410 --> 00:20:42,640
It was much more interesting

384
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:44,440
than watching it in the stadium.

385
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:47,290
We lay on the grass together.

386
00:20:47,550 --> 00:20:49,240
Above us, a sky full of stars.

387
00:20:49,890 --> 00:20:52,240
And by our ears, Han Geng's singing.

388
00:20:52,270 --> 00:20:53,930
Have you ever experienced it?

389
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:57,540
I've never seen anyone
who's so proud to be scammed.

390
00:20:59,130 --> 00:20:59,590
Yes.

391
00:21:00,590 --> 00:21:03,550
I was afraid you would find out
that I was scammed.

392
00:21:04,110 --> 00:21:05,840
That would make me look stupid.

393
00:21:06,550 --> 00:21:08,500
But I've figured it out these days.

394
00:21:08,750 --> 00:21:11,080
I think it's more stupid
to feel this fear.

395
00:21:12,110 --> 00:21:13,400
So what if I tell you now?

396
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:14,640
I feel much better.

397
00:21:15,550 --> 00:21:16,440
Zhao Shuran,

398
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:18,160
you should find a new topic

399
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:19,240
to talk to me now.

400
00:21:20,030 --> 00:21:20,830
Wait.

401
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:23,830
No one talks to you

402
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:25,400
except for me, right?

403
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:26,270
You...

404
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:27,770
You have no friends.

405
00:21:28,350 --> 00:21:30,480
Consider changing your personality.

406
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:44,130
[A hundred-year undertaking
begins with education]

407
00:22:08,510 --> 00:22:11,400
