widespread attention.

409
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:16,960
But today,

410
00:22:17,270 --> 00:22:19,870
I-I want to specifically discuss
the impact of

411
00:22:22,070 --> 00:22:23,110
m-microplastic.

412
00:22:24,510 --> 00:22:26,350
Currently, microplastic

413
00:22:26,380 --> 00:22:27,200
h-has...

414
00:22:27,400 --> 00:22:28,460
What are you doing?

415
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:31,000
Zeqiu, I'm stuttering.

416
00:22:31,960 --> 00:22:32,720
Stuttering?

417
00:22:33,750 --> 00:22:35,680
I have to present at the seminar tomorrow,

418
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:37,070
but now I stutter the moment I speak.

419
00:22:37,070 --> 00:22:38,790
I can't tell you're stuttering at all.

420
00:22:38,790 --> 00:22:39,790
Come and listen.

421
00:22:40,510 --> 00:22:42,170
Let me see what the problem is.

422
00:22:44,550 --> 00:22:45,550
Hello, everyone.

423
00:22:46,070 --> 00:22:48,920
I'm today's high school student
representative, Lin Zhixia.

424
00:22:48,920 --> 00:22:50,400
Today, I...

425
00:22:51,550 --> 00:22:54,350
Today I want to talk about the impact of

426
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:55,270
mi...

427
00:22:56,440 --> 00:22:58,240
m-microplastic...

428
00:22:59,110 --> 00:22:59,920
r-rubbish...

429
00:23:01,570 --> 00:23:03,970
on marine pollution.

430
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:04,390
Wait.

431
00:23:04,410 --> 00:23:05,160
Wait.

432
00:23:06,500 --> 00:23:09,240
You don't usually talk like this.

433
00:23:09,750 --> 00:23:10,920
I don't know either.

434
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:13,860
I get nervous whenever
I think of the speech.

435
00:23:15,930 --> 00:23:16,760
Try again.

436
00:23:16,790 --> 00:23:17,640
One more time.

437
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:19,760
One more time.

438
00:23:21,420 --> 00:23:22,440
Actually,

439
00:23:26,070 --> 00:23:28,680
the pollution o-of plastic waste

440
00:23:30,070 --> 00:23:32,510
h-has already drawn widespread concern.

441
00:23:32,510 --> 00:23:33,310
That's enough.

442
00:23:33,310 --> 00:23:34,950
Alright, alright.

443
00:23:35,510 --> 00:23:37,110
What kind of problem is this?

444
00:23:37,510 --> 00:23:39,400
I finally understand why Jiang Yubai

445
00:23:39,400 --> 00:23:41,640
stuttered when he first saw me.

446
00:23:43,030 --> 00:23:44,350
What should I do?

447
00:23:49,750 --> 00:23:51,010
I can't help with this.

448
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:53,160
Nope. Can't help you.

449
00:23:53,830 --> 00:23:55,550
You can't leave.

450
00:23:56,270 --> 00:23:57,680
You're stuttering. It's a condition.

451
00:23:57,680 --> 00:23:58,540
I can't cure it.

452
00:23:59,230 --> 00:24:00,720
Please help me.

453
00:24:00,790 --> 00:24:01,720
I can't help you.

454
00:24:01,720 --> 00:24:03,160
Zeqiu, please help me.

455
00:24:03,160 --> 00:24:04,680
My presentation is tomorrow.

456
00:24:04,680 --> 00:24:07,110
I'm going to discuss with the experts
on behalf of high school students.

457
00:24:07,110 --> 00:24:08,720
Professor Shen gave me this chance.

458
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:11,030
I can't screw it up no matter what!

459
00:24:11,030 --> 00:24:11,750
Zeqiu!

460
00:24:11,750 --> 00:24:13,440
I need someone to practice on.

461
00:24:13,440 --> 00:24:14,480
If you listen to my presentation,

462
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:15,680
