463
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:16,350
If I do well,

464
00:24:16,350 --> 00:24:18,160
wouldn't you be happy, Zeqiu?

465
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:19,480
Yes.

466
00:24:19,720 --> 00:24:21,980
Aren't you talking quite well right now?

467
00:24:23,240 --> 00:24:23,960
Right?

468
00:24:24,350 --> 00:24:25,400
Relax.

469
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:27,480
Just persuade others the way
you persuade me.

470
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:28,720
Take your time.

471
00:24:28,880 --> 00:24:30,480
A seminar is basically
just people chatting.

472
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:31,880
Like how we're chatting.

473
00:24:32,350 --> 00:24:33,030
Okay?

474
00:24:33,240 --> 00:24:34,040
One more time.

475
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:41,510
Zeqiu, please help me.

476
00:24:41,510 --> 00:24:42,270
My presentation is tomorrow.

477
00:24:42,270 --> 00:24:43,110
I'm going to discuss with the experts
on behalf of...

478
00:24:43,110 --> 00:24:44,720
Wait, wait, wait.

479
00:24:44,720 --> 00:24:46,640
Read your script.

480
00:24:56,030 --> 00:24:58,180
Zhixia, did you bring everything?

481
00:25:01,680 --> 00:25:02,480
Zhixia,

482
00:25:03,550 --> 00:25:05,080
bring these 2 eggs with you.

483
00:25:05,590 --> 00:25:07,990
Eat them if you're hungry while traveling.

484
00:25:08,750 --> 00:25:10,610
You'll be living alone out there.

485
00:25:10,640 --> 00:25:12,160
You really don't need us to accompany you?

486
00:25:12,160 --> 00:25:14,240
It's fine, I'm just going to the suburbs.

487
00:25:14,240 --> 00:25:16,590
Okay. Take this money.

488
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:18,270
Keep it close and don't lose it.

489
00:25:18,270 --> 00:25:20,720
Food and accommodation are covered.
I don't need to spend money.

490
00:25:20,720 --> 00:25:22,240
Doesn't hurt to be prepared.

491
00:25:22,240 --> 00:25:22,960
Take it.

492
00:25:22,960 --> 00:25:24,720
Keep it properly. Don't lose it.

493
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:25,830
Why are you up?

494
00:25:25,830 --> 00:25:26,830
Let me send her there, Mom.

495
00:25:26,830 --> 00:25:27,720
You will?

496
00:25:27,720 --> 00:25:28,200
I will.

497
00:25:28,200 --> 00:25:28,830
Alright.

498
00:25:29,550 --> 00:25:30,270
I'm leaving, Mom.

499
00:25:30,270 --> 00:25:31,590
Be careful.

500
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:34,720
Don't sleep in the car. Be alert.

501
00:25:35,030 --> 00:25:36,310
When you're out and about,

502
00:25:36,310 --> 00:25:38,440
nothing is more important than safety.

503
00:25:38,440 --> 00:25:40,310
You must lock the door.

504
00:25:40,310 --> 00:25:41,030
Got that?

505
00:25:42,990 --> 00:25:49,170
[Healthy Living]

506
00:25:43,270 --> 00:25:46,270
Don't just lock the door.

507
00:25:46,750 --> 00:25:49,720
Lock up whatever chain lock or bolt lock

508
00:25:50,880 --> 00:25:52,410
you can find on the door too.

509
00:25:52,680 --> 00:25:53,350
Got that?

510
00:26:05,110 --> 00:26:05,880
Wang Tao.

511
00:26:10,920 --> 00:26:12,350
Last summer vacation,

512
00:26:12,750 --> 00:26:14,480
they went on a family vacation.

513
00:26:15,030 --> 00:26:16,030
When they checked in,

514
00:26:16,030 --> 00:26:18,890
they learned that a fire once broke out
in the hotel,

515
00:26:19,270 --> 00:26:20,730
killing dozens of people.

516
00:26:21,400 --> 00:26:22,500
But they didn't take it seriously

517
00:26:22,500 --> 00:26:23,440
and moved in.

518
00:26:24,510 --> 00:26:25,710
That night,

519
00:26:25,770 --> 00:26:28,370
his mother and his sister
were in the same room.

520
00:26:28,790 --> 00:26:30,070
At 3 a.m.,

521
00:26:30,070 --> 00:26:32,150
his mother was fast asleep.

522
00:26:32,790 --> 00:26:37,640
His sister was awakened
by the sound of knocking.

523
00:26:38,510 --> 00:26:39,160
Knock...

524
00:26:40,070 --> 00:26:40,720
Knock...

525
00:26:41,750 --> 00:26:42,400
Knock...

526
00:26:43,160 --> 00:26:43,790
Knock...

527
00:26:45,790 --> 00:26:47,850
It sounded like someone was carefully

528
00:26:47,850 --> 00:26:50,440
knocking on the door with their knuckles.

529
00:26:54,610 --> 00:26:56,390
Isn't Wang Tao your
primary school classmate?

530
00:26:56,390 --> 00:26:57,450
Yes, that Wang Tao.

531
00:26:58,030 --> 00:26:59,150
I thought he had a brother.

532
00:26:59,150 --> 00:27:00,610
How did it become a sister?

533
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:02,920
It was a sister all along.
You remembered wrongly.

534
00:27:02,920 --> 00:27:03,960
Let me continue.

535
00:27:05,440 --> 00:27:10,110
His sister got up to check
who was outside the door.

536
00:27:07,730 --> 00:27:13,700
[Healthy Living]

537
00:27:10,810 --> 00:27:13,410
At that moment,
the sound of knocking stopped.

538
00:27:14,440 --> 00:27:16,500
His sister thought she had misheard,

539
00:27:16,510 --> 00:27:18,030
and went back to bed.

540
00:27:18,030 --> 00:27:20,110
But the moment she lay down,

541
00:27:20,270 --> 00:27:22,750
the knocking started again.

542
00:27:23,640 --> 00:27:24,500
Knock, knock, knock!

543
00:27:24,500 --> 00:27:25,700
Knock, knock, knock!

544
00:27:26,240 --> 00:27:28,970
His sister looked outside
through the peephole.

545
00:27:30,350 --> 00:27:33,110
There was no one outside,

546
00:27:34,750 --> 00:27:36,750
but the light in the corridor was on.

547
00:27:37,900 --> 00:27:38,480
At this moment,

548
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:40,210
she made a very wrong decision.

549
00:27:40,750 --> 00:27:42,350
She opened the door.

550
00:27:46,160 --> 00:27:46,960
Suddenly!

551
00:27:49,010 --> 00:27:51,030
A gust of cold wind poured in,

552
00:27:51,030 --> 00:27:53,200
accompanied by a burnt smell.

553
00:27:53,310 --> 00:27:54,960
His sister rushed to bed
and continued sleeping.

554
00:27:54,960 --> 00:27:55,830
When she woke up the next morning,

555
00:27:55,830 --> 00:27:57,310
guess what they found.

556
00:27:57,400 --> 00:27:58,440
What did they find?

557
00:27:58,440 --> 00:28:00,640
They found black handprints

558
00:28:00,640 --> 00:28:02,880
all over her bed.

559
00:28:03,680 --> 00:28:05,030
It was as if those who died in the fire

560
00:28:05,030 --> 00:28:07,160
wiped their hands all over the sheets.

561
00:28:07,590 --> 00:28:10,480
Because she opened the door,

562
00:28:10,920 --> 00:28:12,590
they were allowed inside.

563
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:17,070
This story

564
00:28:17,510 --> 00:28:19,030
tells us that when one is out and about,

565
00:28:19,030 --> 00:28:19,830
we must lock the door

566
00:28:19,830 --> 00:28:21,430
and never open it for anyone.

567
00:28:23,350 --> 00:28:24,830
This story tells us that

568
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:27,730
you need to be logical
when making up stories.

569
00:28:27,850 --> 00:28:29,980
You're really bad at telling stories.

570
00:28:30,720 --> 00:28:32,510
No, this really happened.

571
00:28:32,720 --> 00:28:33,440
Really?

572
00:28:33,720 --> 00:28:34,350
Really.

573
00:28:34,830 --> 00:28:35,880
It really happened?

574
00:28:35,880 --> 00:28:36,920
Just ask Wang Tao.

575
00:28:40,940 --> 00:28:41,900
Wang Tao?

576
00:28:42,220 --> 00:28:42,750
Wang Tao.

577
00:31:02,250 --> 00:31:05,420
The sound of knocking was slow and light.

578
00:31:06,090 --> 00:31:08,090
Knock... Knock...

579
00:31:10,530 --> 00:31:12,500
It sounded like someone was carefully

580
00:31:12,500 --> 00:31:15,220
knocking on the door with their knuckles.

581
00:31:39,180 --> 00:31:39,940
Who is it?

582
00:31:49,240 --> 00:31:50,750
When she asked who was outside the door,

583
00:31:50,750 --> 00:31:53,030
the sound of knocking suddenly stopped.

584
00:31:53,380 --> 00:31:56,140
His sister looked outside
through the peephole,

585
00:31:57,140 --> 00:31:59,850
but there was no one outside.

586
00:31:59,980 --> 00:32:00,530
At this moment,

587
00:32:00,530 --> 00:32:02,460
she made a very wrong decision.

588
00:32:02,770 --> 00:32:04,380
She opened the door.

589
00:32:06,400 --> 00:32:07,200
Suddenly!

590
00:33:17,610 --> 00:33:24,790
[Unknown Number]

591
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:26,980
Hello, Lin Zhixia.

592
00:33:32,880 --> 00:33:34,480
How did you know it was me?

593
00:33:36,700 --> 00:33:37,300
I guessed.

594
00:33:45,610 --> 00:33:46,290
Hello.

595
00:33:47,290 --> 00:33:47,900
Please

596
00:33:47,900 --> 00:33:49,770
tell the guest in Room 3021

597
00:33:50,610 --> 00:33:53,420
that her friend
left something for her at her door.

598
00:34:03,970 --> 00:34:07,010
[Do Not Disturb]

599
00:34:31,940 --> 00:34:34,460
The seminar happens tomorrow morning.

600
00:34:35,940 --> 00:34:38,170
I thought I'd be kept up by excitement,

601
00:34:38,650 --> 00:34:40,260
not nervousness.

602
00:34:41,610 --> 00:34:44,090
And I keep hearing noises
outside the door.

603
00:34:45,500 --> 00:34:46,170
Lin Zhixia,

604
00:34:46,820 --> 00:34:48,050
you're not nervous.

605
00:34:48,610 --> 00:34:49,870
You're scared, right?

606
00:34:55,730 --> 00:34:56,929
Looks like I'm right.

607
00:34:58,380 --> 00:34:59,170
I admit

608
00:35:00,340 --> 00:35:01,800
I'm a little scared.

609
00:35:03,900 --> 00:35:05,300
It's empty here

610
00:35:05,900 --> 00:35:07,340
and too quiet.

611
00:35:16,420 --> 00:35:17,010
Then...

612
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:20,530
Are you afraid of the universe?

613
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:22,110
No.

614
00:35:25,090 --> 00:35:26,890
But the universe is also silent.

615
00:35:30,940 --> 00:35:31,940
I understand now.

616
00:35:33,300 --> 00:35:35,210
My fear comes from the unknown.

617
00:35:36,900 --> 00:35:38,700
I know what the universe is like,

618
00:35:38,980 --> 00:35:40,240
so I'm not afraid of it.

619
00:35:40,800 --> 00:35:43,840
So, silence itself is not scary,

620
00:35:44,710 --> 00:35:45,400
right?

621
00:35:47,360 --> 00:35:48,280
You're right.

622
00:35:51,920 --> 00:35:52,630
Hello?

623
00:35:53,130 --> 00:35:53,840
Hello.

624
00:35:54,090 --> 00:35:56,230
Room 3021's line is currently occupied.

625
00:35:56,230 --> 00:35:57,630
We'll inform them later.

626
00:35:59,320 --> 00:36:01,150
Okay, thank you.

627
00:36:07,360 --> 00:36:08,150
Occupied?

628
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:12,030
Lin Zhixia, go to bed early.

629
00:36:12,280 --> 00:36:14,210
You have a presentation tomorrow.

630
00:36:14,360 --> 00:36:16,550
Don't be scared, I won't hang up.

631
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:33,400
Good night, Jiang Yubai.

632
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:35,670
Good night.

633
00:36:36,800 --> 00:36:37,590
Lin Zhixia.

634
00:37:32,880 --> 00:37:33,590
Hello?

635
00:37:34,480 --> 00:37:35,150
Hello.

636
00:37:35,510 --> 00:37:37,710
Room 3021's line is still occupied.

637
00:37:38,280 --> 00:37:40,210
Do you still need me to call for you?

638
00:37:41,320 --> 00:37:42,920
Is the line always occupied?

639
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:43,730
Yes.

640
00:37:44,940 --> 00:37:45,800
How about this?

641
00:37:46,090 --> 00:37:48,250
We'll try to contact them
every once in a while.

642
00:37:48,250 --> 00:37:50,780
We'll let you know
when it gets through, okay?

643
00:37:52,400 --> 00:37:53,860
Okay, thank you.

644
00:37:54,340 --> 00:37:55,270
You're welcome.

645
00:38:44,920 --> 00:38:45,840
Jiang Yubai.

646
00:38:54,880 --> 00:38:55,880
Why are you awake?

647
00:38:56,360 --> 00:38:57,890
Just sleep a little longer.

648
00:39:06,940 --> 00:39:07,480
Okay.

649
00:40:49,780 --> 00:40:50,840
Lin Zhixia!

650
00:40:53,170 --> 00:40:55,630
Lin Zhixia, I'm here!

651
00:41:03,190 --> 00:41:04,460
Jiang Yubai!

652
00:41:08,190 --> 00:41:09,630
Jiang Yubai!

653
00:41:52,710 --> 00:41:54,670
Jiang Yubai, are you still there?

654
00:41:58,800 --> 00:41:59,510
Yes.

655
00:42:04,510 --> 00:42:05,920
Did you stay up all night?

656
00:42:08,230 --> 00:42:10,510
Are you still scared?

657
00:42:13,550 --> 00:42:14,360
A little.

658
00:42:19,400 --> 00:42:20,400
But with you here,

659
00:42:20,960 --> 00:42:22,290
I'm not afraid anymore.

660
00:43:01,030 --> 00:43:01,830
Why are you...

661
00:43:05,070 --> 00:43:06,480
Can I hang up now?

662
00:43:12,010 --> 00:43:14,670
[In Call]

663
00:43:18,980 --> 00:43:20,340
When we were young,

664
00:43:21,530 --> 00:43:23,400
we had to do something crazy

665
00:43:23,980 --> 00:43:25,340
to live up to our youth.

666
00:43:27,410 --> 00:43:28,040
For me,

667
00:43:28,760 --> 00:43:30,290
I could stay up all night

668
00:43:30,480 --> 00:43:33,080
to stare at microplastic
under the microscope

669
00:43:34,030 --> 00:43:36,030
and find charm in something boring.

670
00:43:37,730 --> 00:43:40,070
Because his friend was afraid of silence,

671
00:43:42,960 --> 00:43:43,760
he could

672
00:43:44,670 --> 00:43:46,530
spend the entire night listening

673
00:43:46,590 --> 00:43:48,770
to the air conditioner all night long.

674
00:43:50,980 --> 00:43:53,640
Someone could sacrifice
his favorite sneakers

675
00:43:53,900 --> 00:43:56,370
to fulfill his friend's wishes.

676
00:43:58,860 --> 00:44:00,160
At that time, we thought

677
00:44:00,160 --> 00:44:02,120
these actions were impulsive

678
00:44:02,550 --> 00:44:03,210
and passionate.

679
00:44:02,800 --> 00:44:06,040
[Han Geng]

680
00:44:04,800 --> 00:44:06,600
When we grew up, we realized that

681
00:44:06,760 --> 00:44:08,620
it was the silent source of energy

682
00:44:09,340 --> 00:44:11,400
powering all original aspirations.

683
00:44:15,000 --> 00:44:17,360
The passion of youth can outlast time.

684
00:44:22,600 --> 00:44:27,150
[Study Plan]

685
00:44:23,400 --> 00:44:25,800
From today to tomorrow,

686
00:44:28,010 --> 00:44:28,880
to forever.
